","parts":[{"text":"வந்தென","lemma":"வந்தென","gloss":"as they returned"}],"gloss":"as they returned","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புன்","parts":[{"text":"புன்","lemma":"புன்","gloss":"dusty/lowly"}],"gloss":"dusty"},{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"place/head"}],"gloss":"place"},{"surface":"மன்றம்","parts":[{"text":"மன்றம்","lemma":"மன்றம்","gloss":"common ground"}],"gloss":"common ground"},{"surface":"நோக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நோக்கு","lemma":"நோக்கு","gloss":"look"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"looking towards"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மட","parts":[{"text":"மட","lemma":"மடமை","gloss":"innocent"}],"gloss":"innocent"},{"surface":"கண்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"eyed"},{"surface":"குழவி","parts":[{"text":"குழவி","lemma":"குழவி","gloss":"calf"}],"gloss":"calf"},{"surface":"அலவந்து","parts":[{"text":"அலவந்து","lemma":"அலவந்து","gloss":"having been distressed"}],"gloss":"having been distressed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோயேம்","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"pain/distress"},{"text":"ஏம்","lemma":"ஏம்","gloss":"we"}],"gloss":"we who are in distress"},{"surface":"ஆகுதல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"becoming"},{"surface":"அறிந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"அறிந்தும்","lemma":"அறிந்தும்","gloss":"even though knowing"}],"gloss":"even though knowing","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சேயர்","parts":[{"text":"சேய்","lemma":"சேய்","gloss":"distance"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he is far away"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"சேய்","parts":[{"text":"சேய்","lemma":"சேய்","gloss":"distant"}],"gloss":"distant"},{"surface":"நாட்டோரே","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டோரே","lemma":"நாட்டோரே","gloss":"he of the land"}],"gloss":"he of the land","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"many cows to the long path having gone far as they returned / looking towards the dusty-headed common ground in the evening / like an innocent-eyed calf that is distressed / even though knowing that we are in pain / he is far away, O friend, he of the distant land.","translation":"O friend, he of the distant land remains far away, even though he knows that we suffer in the evening, looking towards the dusty common ground, like an innocent-eyed calf distressed as the many cows return after going far along the long path.","modern":"தோழி! பல பசுக்கள் நீண்ட வழியில் தூரத்தே சென்றுவிட்டுத் திரும்பியதால், மாலையில் புழுதி நிறைந்த பொதுமன்றத்தை நோக்கி, மடப்பம் பொருந்திய கண்களையுடைய கன்று வருந்துவதைப் போல, நாமும் துன்பமடைவதை அறிந்திருந்தும், சேய்மையான நாட்டின் தலைவன் இன்னும் தூரத்திலேயே இருக்கிறான்.","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine talking to her confidante during the mullai (forest) season, which is the time of the hero's expected return. The evening has arrived, and the cows are returning from their pastures to the common ground of the village. The heroine compares her own distress to that of a young, innocent-eyed calf that anxiously waits and looks towards the common ground for its mother. This image of the returning cows and the waiting calf is characteristic of the mullai landscape, representing patient waiting and the domestic warmth of return. Yet, the hero, who belongs to a distant land, remains far away, neglecting her grief despite knowing her suffering. Key words include 'மன்றம்' (common ground), 'மாலை' (evening), 'குழவி' (calf), and 'நோய்' (pain/distress).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}